# Lines, rectangles and ellipses on a fresh canvas.
spawn
wait "Welcome" 10s
keys esc
wait idle
keys r
wait "RECT"
click 103 16
drag 3 2 30 11
click 110 7
click 109 16
drag 36 2 62 9
keys o
wait "ELLIPSE"
click 112 16
drag 4 13 30 23
keys l
wait "LINE"
click 100 16
drag 36 22 76 12
drag 36 12 76 22
mouse move 70 4
wait idle
shot shapes
